nt-mono); direction: ltr; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing:=
 normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 2; hyphens: none; =
padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em;"><co=
